    "title": "Eventeny",
    "description": "The Eventeny App is currently in its early beta stages. We're actively working on developing a mobile experience where discovering, attending, and organizing events are made easier on the go! \r\n\r\nAttending an event? Key app features: \r\nFind information about your upcoming event.\r\nUse the scan-and-go ticket entry tool.\r\nMake safe and secure payments.\r\nDiscover scheduled activities\r\nExplore events near you.\r\n\r\nOrganizing an event? Key app features: \r\nVolunteer shift management. \r\nArtist, vendor, and exhibitor check-in. \r\nTicket scanning and add-on redemption. \r\nInteractive event schedule and map. \r\nMarketplace hosting. \r\n\r\nAs a beta tester, we would love to hear your feedback. Please send your suggestions to support@eventeny.com so we can help improve your experience. :) \r\n\r\nAccess our full suite of features and learn more about Eventeny at https://www.eventeny.com/",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Eventeny App is currently in its early beta stages. We&#39;re actively working on developing a mobile experience where discovering, attending, and organizing events are made easier on the go! <br><br>Attending an event? Key app features: <br>Find information about your upcoming event.<br>Use the scan-and-go ticket entry tool.<br>Make safe and secure payments.<br>Discover scheduled activities<br>Explore events near you.<br><br>Organizing an event? Key app features: <br>Volunteer shift management. <br>Artist, vendor, and exhibitor check-in. <br>Ticket scanning and add-on redemption. <br>Interactive event schedule and map. <br>Marketplace hosting. <br><br>As a beta tester, we would love to hear your feedback. Please send your suggestions to support@eventeny.com so we can help improve your experience. :) <br><br>Access our full suite of features and learn more about Eventeny at https://www.eventeny.com/",
